<table style="width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:10.5pt; margin-bottom:14px;">
    <tr>
        <th style="border:1px solid #444; padding:6px;">Payable in EUR to EBS</th>
        <th style="border:1px solid #444; padding:6px;">Approximate Payment Date</th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="border:1px solid #444; padding:6px;">Tuition Fees – 12,000 (6000 x 2)</td>
        <td style="border:1px solid #444; padding:6px;">Sep 2025 / Jan 2026</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="border:1px solid #444; padding:6px;">Enrolment Fees – 690</td>
        <td style="border:1px solid #444; padding:6px;">July 2025</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style="border:1px solid #444; padding:6px;">Semester Ticket – 400 (200 x 2 approx.)</td>
        <td style="border:1px solid #444; padding:6px;">Sep 2025 / Jan 2026</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<div style="font-size:10.5pt; line-height:1.5; margin-bottom:10px;">
    The details of the mode of payment will be communicated in the offer letter from EBS.
</div>

